{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53412","headline":"答颜太守 · 林藴","name":"答颜太守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"物力孤穷甚，无由蔽草庐。\n抱疴明盛世，丐食兵荒余。\n马革藏身拙，鸱夷报主疎。\n勉哉吾二子，太岁易消除。\n（见《王氏刊唐人集》收《林邵州遗集》，注云：「见郑王臣《莆风清籁集》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}